            "text": "Archangel, Bialzhar, Sarandiel, Vilespine, and Lichlord Nefraxis equipment are part of the current boss-equipment layer. These items are obtained from Alvaro in exchange for Raid Points. Their base tier, cap level, PvP damage reduction, attack power, and Monster Essence values match the Kraken and Forgemaster equipment layer, while each set has its own set bonus."
